  "description": "The proposed development includes the construction of an underground storage tank (east side of the park) and a wetland on the west side of the park. The scheme proposes diverting the surface water from the Thames Water system into the underground storage tank during the peak flooding events. There will be pipes connecting the tank and the wetlands to regulate the water levels. More information on the scheme can be found in the documents package.",
